{"tmdb":1661922,"tagline":"","synopsis":"A young couple in 1973. Iria is a migrant worker from Spain; Hajo is a student from Germany. When Iria’s mother becomes terminally ill, they decide to leave Köln and take her back to Galicia. Their road trip leads them through a variety of social and political systems that existed in the 1970s, while their relationship comes to reflect the zeitgeist.","directors":[{"name":"Stefan Butzmühlen","id":40492},{"name":"Cristina Diz","id":1990892}],"cast":[{"actor":"Greta Fernández","role":"Iria","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iNZZThidLYeZGBZGi9qhsVA1YRd.jpg","tmdb":1061583},{"actor":"Jan Bülow","role":"Hajo","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vaPOonKtRjm5ofCBX9yfRCvvbKK.jpg","tmdb":1464087},{"actor":"Mercedes Castro","role":"Maura","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/slPgNuxAZi6MBIOzLH78VqF76k.jpg","tmdb":942791},{"actor":"Darío Loureiro","role":"Lois","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6ylOfRtSIz1GwJBQVk82FkIwktb.jpg","tmdb":4442003},{"actor":"Santi Prego","role":"Carlos","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vwaDXtQC7jwxnbDPfA5QjPFBX15.jpg","tmdb":1071971},{"actor":"Filipe Abalde","role":"","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/53Z3DcTw1yHCo8Mi3njNc4s94P6.jpg","tmdb":3062981}],"trailers":[],"official":null,"watch":{},"artwork":{"posters":[["/h1q4Mc5hoatgg8bbUX9eYupalaP.jpg",1532,2298]],"backdrops":[],"logos":[]}}